## Additional Use Restrictions

The above permission is granted subject to the following additional
restrictions ("Use Restrictions"). Any use of the Software that violates
these restrictions is NOT permitted by this license:

1. **No bulk scraping or harvesting.** You may not use the Software to
   automatically scrape, crawl, batch-fetch, or otherwise harvest content,
   job postings, user data, or personal information from any third-party
   website or platform at scale, or to circumvent any technical protection,
   rate limit, or anti-bot measure of such platforms.

2. **No automated impersonation of human users.** You may not use the
   Software to automate, bulk-produce, or mass-dispatch messages (including
   but not limited to chat messages, applications, or greetings) to evade a
   platform's human-verification or anti-spam systems, or to impersonate
   human activity for the purpose of defeating platform controls.

3. **User accountability.** You are solely responsible for complying with
   the terms of service of any website or platform you use the Software
