4. **No liability for misuse.** The authors and copyright holders are not
   liable for any damages, account suspensions, or legal consequences
   arising from your use of the Software in violation of these Use
   Restrictions or of a third party's terms of service.

These Use Restrictions are an integral part of this license. If any
provision is held invalid or unenforceable, the remaining provisions shall
